@startuml
!theme plain

title Component Diagram

cloud "User's Browser" as Browser {
  [Frontend Web App (JS, HTML, CSS)] as Frontend
}

node "NAS Docker Environment" as NAS {
    database "ContextDB (SQLite)" as DB

    package "Python Application" {
        [Web Server & API (FastAPI)] as API
        [Backend Engine (Watcher)] as Engine
    }

    package "AI Service" {
        [Ollama] as Ollama
    }
}

Frontend -right-> API : HTTP/API Calls\n(Search, Get Context)
API -left-> Frontend : WebSocket Pushes\n(Real-time Updates)

API -down-> DB : Reads/Writes
Engine -down-> DB : Writes
Engine -right-> Ollama : Analyzes Text
API -up-> Engine : (Optional) Triggers Rescan

@enduml